:: f4 [map]
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <div class='explore-box'>
    <h3>EXPLORE</h3>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Talk to the merchant.->f4: merchant]]</li>
      <li>[[Check the long grass.->f4: long grass]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <<map 'f4'>><<n>><<w>><</map>><<set $currentLocation = 'f4'>>
</div>

:: f4: merchant
<p>There's a merchant here!</p>
<p>She seems friendly.</p>
<p>"I wait here to collect the rafts that people use to float down the Great River."</p>
<p>"We also have e-bikes in stock! They're available for the low price of 1,000 coins."</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[That seems quite absurd. Try to haggle.->f4: haggle]]</li>
  <li>[[Another time.->$currentLocation]]</li>
</ul>

:: f4: haggle
<<if (($players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.paddle == true) and ($players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.shine == true))>>
  <p>"You've beaten Rhia *and* Matiu in the school challenge?"</p>
  <p>That's quite impressive. You can have an ebike for free!</p>
  <<link 'You get an ebike!' $currentLocation>>
    <<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.ebike = true>>
  <</link>>
<<elseif $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.paddle == true>>
    "You already tackled the Wave School challenge and won?!" she says.

    "Rhia is so impressive. Don't you think? I wish I had half of her fashion sense."

    She looks you up and down with a surprised look. "You must be quite skilled with Mergimals. I can give you a discount: only 1/10th of the normal price."

    <<nobr>>
        <<link 'Sure!'>>
            <<if $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].backpack.coin < 100>>
                <<dialog 'not enough coins'>>\
                    <<include 'not enough coins'>>
                <</dialog>>
            <<else>>
                <<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].backpack.coin -= 100>>
                <<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.ebike = true>>
            <</if>>
        <</link>>
    <</nobr>>
    [[Nevermind.->f4]]
<<elseif $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.shine == true>>
    "You already tackled the Forge School challenge and won?!" she says.

    "Matiu seems kinda scary. I don't know how you were able to work up the courage to even try!"

    She looks you up and down with a surprised look. "You must be quite skilled with Mergimals. I can give you a discount: only 1/10th of the normal price."

    <<nobr>>
        <<link 'Sure!'>>
            <<if $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].backpack.coin < 100>>
                <<dialog 'not enough coins'>>\
                    <<include 'not enough coins'>>
                <</dialog>>
            <<else>>
                <<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].backpack.coin -= 100>>
                <<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.ebike = true>>
            <</if>>
        <</link>>
    <</nobr>>
    [[Nevermind.->f4]]
<<else>>
    "Sorry to say, I can't do any better."

    "Come back when you've completed some school challenges."

    <<nobr>>
        <<link 'Alright, I guess.'>>
            <<if $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].backpack.coin < 1000>>
                <<dialog 'not enough coins'>>\
                    <<include 'not enough coins'>>
                <</dialog>>
            <<else>>
                <<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].backpack.coin -= 1000>>
                <<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.ebike = true>>
            <</if>>
        <</link>>
    <</nobr>>
    [[Nevermind.->f4]]
<</if>>

:: f4: long grass
<p>The noises you heard before are even louder now. You can tell this long grass is full of Mergimals. You just need to see which ones you can find!</p>
<p style='font-weight: bold;'>Roll 1d20</p>
<p>If you got...</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>
    <<link '1-12 (common)' 'stray encounter'>>
      <<set $mergimalEncountered = $mergimals[$encounterTable[$currentLocation].common]>>
    <</link>>
  </li>
  <li>
    <<link '1-17 (uncommon)' 'stray encounter'>>
      <<set $mergimalEncountered = $mergimals[$encounterTable[$currentLocation].uncommon]>>
    <</link>>
  </li>
  <li>
    <<link '1-20 (rare)' 'stray encounter'>>
      <<set $mergimalEncountered = $mergimals[$encounterTable[$currentLocation].rare]>>
    <</link>>
  </li>
  <li>[[Continue exploring.->$currentLocation]]</li>
</ul>